Shouldn't there be a few different classes of henchmen.

1)  Pets.  (Any creature you can't really talk to, like your dog.)
2)  Henchman (Any intellegent creature you can talk to.  It will demand
gold or some reward to help you out.)
3)  Friend (Any intellegent creature that you can talk to.  It will not
ask for payment.  A charmed dwarf would fit in this catagory.  A tame
lich created from a blessed figurine would also fit in this catagory.)


